0..61 Comment "//! `spokenFirst` has a task speak before the parent asks it."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..146 Comment "//! The task\'s send, the parent receipt and the parent answer reverse the forced"
147..196 Comment "//! chain. A forced web does not settle this run."
197..200 Comment "//!"
201..278 Comment "//! The task sends notes, then reads the parent answer. The annotations state"
279..331 Comment "//! the web the runner reports against a forced web."
332..335 Comment "//!"
336..396 Comment "//! - see: `forced.gandr` — the same exchange, asked first"
397..473 Comment "//! - see: #3338 — the run trace and the web a source states for a channel"
474..513 Comment "// The import gives the task protocols."
